    narr:narration """The operational status of the [Kestrelwood spectrograph](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_3) has been established through a series of technical validations performed on July 15, 2026. The current [calibration frequency](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_1) is set at 88.4 MHz, a figure that has been [formally verified](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_2) against established reference plates from June. This process reflects a broader [verification protocol](narr:Narrative_KestrelwoodSpectrographCalibrationVerification) where instrument states are confirmed across the full observing band prior to reliance. The session concluded with a [consolidated decision record](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_4) that formalizes these parameters as the current baseline for the instrument.""" ;
